                            <td>
                                DIMENSIONAL VARIANCE - 10150 PINE PARK TRAIL ACCESSORY STRUCTURE SIZE AND HEIGHT - A request by Todd Wood for approval of a Dimensional Variance to allow an accessory structure of no more than 8,000 square feet in size and 40 feet in height where a structure would normally be limited to 2,972 square feet in size, and 30 feet in height. The El Paso County Land Development Code specifically prohibits accessory structures from being more than two times the size of the building footprint of the principal use. The 5-acre property is located at 10150 Pine Park Trail, approximately .35 miles east of the intersection of Pine Park Trail and Raygor Road in Colorado Springs, Colorado. (Parcel No. 5223001013) (Commissioner District No. 2) (BOA-25-008) 
