                                25-310
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                VACATION AND REPLAT - CLAREMONT BUSINESS PARK 2 FILING NO. 3 - A request by Brian Zurek for approval of a 1.808-acre Vacation and Replat creating two commercial lots sized 0.855 acres and 0.771acres, and a tract of 0.182 acres. The property is zoned CS (Commercial Service) and is located at 1541 El Jefe Heights. The item was heard on the consent agenda at the November 6, 2025, Planning Commission meeting and was recommended for approval with a vote of 5-0. (Parcel No. 5405412013) (Commissioner District No. 2) (VR-25-001) 
                            </td>
                        <td>
                            <a href="/iip/elpaso/file/getfile/51165">
