                            <td>
                                ESCROW AGREEMENT - PRAIRIE RIDGE FILING NO. 1 - A request by Clovis Point Co, LLC, for approval of an escrow agreement associated with the Prairie Ridge Filing No. 1 subdivision. The 39.77-acre property is zoned RR-5 (Residential Rural) and is located on the east side of Brown Road, approximately one-half of a mile north of the Brown Road and Walker Road intersection and within Section 12, Township 11 South, Range 66 West of the 6th P.M. Pursuant to condition of approval for the subdivision, developer is required to deposit with the county certain sums as is fair, equitable and proportionate contribution toward the construction of improvements to Brown Road. (Parcel No. 61000-00-483)
